Great sutff @AlexCatarino  -- if you find yourself using that tryconvert pattern again with a default value, consider making a utility method, maybe something of the form:

```csharp
public static ConvertToDelegate<T>(this PyObject pyObject, T defaultValue = null)
    where T : class
{
    if (pyObject == null)
    {
        return defaultValue;
    }

    T output;
    if (!pyObject.TryConvertToDelegate(out output)
    {
        return defaultValue;
    }

    return output;
}
```
